  "productSlug": "bitbucket",
  "shortDescription": "Bitbucket Cloud is Atlassian’s Git host with Pipelines CI. Free is unlimited repos for up to 5 users (50 build minutes, 1 GB LFS). Standard is $3.65/user/month with a 5-user minimum bill (~$18.25). Premium is $7.25/user/month (~$36.25 minimum) with IP allowlisting, enforced merge checks, and more minutes. 30-day paid trials typical. Best when the team already lives in Jira — not a GitHub social/ecosystem substitute.",
